# INTRO — plays once when the level starts (CutsceneTrigger with autoplay).
# Story: the Mafia was sent to the fairy realm after a fairy accused of
# ruining the taro terraces. A portal nearly swallowed him; the Fairy saved him.

letterbox on
camera mafia 1.9
wait 0.5
narrate "The windward jungle. Somewhere past the taro terraces."
say Boss "Crops rotting overnight on the terraces. The farmers say a fairy did it. Handle it."
say mafia "Find the fairy. End the problem. Simple."
move fairy -255 0.5
emote fairy "!"
face mafia fairy
camera -280 -60 2.0
say fairy "Simple? An hour ago a portal nearly swallowed you whole. I pulled you out, remember?"
say mafia "I remember a bright light and a very small person yelling."
say fairy "That was me. Yelling helpfully."
emote mafia "..."
say mafia "Fine. Show me these portals."
say fairy "Not yet. Drills first. A and D to move, Space to jump. Hold it to jump higher."
camera_reset
set_flag intro_done
give_shards 1
narrate "You found a Lumen Shard. Press U any time to spend shards on upgrades."
letterbox off
